      <title>Judith Jarvis Thomson: Hayatı, Mirası ve Tarihteki Etkisi (2020)</title>
      <link>https://xmifrmx.github.io/makale/makale/2026-11-20-judith-jarvis-thomson.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">tarih-260e43411708d86c7bbe</guid>
