      <title>Robert Altman: Hayatı, Mirası ve Tarihteki Etkisi (2006)</title>
      <link>https://xmifrmx.github.io/makale/makale/2026-11-20-robert-altman.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">tarih-5826103d8315abf9b73c</guid>
